# Portfolio Enterprise Source (Fixed)

Use this rule when the user wants enterprise/B2B positioning.

Source of truth:
- `portfolio-template-enterprise-b2b.md`

Requirements:
1. Always read `portfolio-template-enterprise-b2b.md` before generating output.
2. Keep the same ASCII template structure.
3. Write all output in English only.
4. Prioritize trust, clarity, technical depth, and measurable project impact.
5. Keep personal information secondary to strengths, projects, and engineering outcomes.
6. Do not switch to creative source unless the user explicitly asks to disable this mode.
